OL,3,GNEWSADecision due on church mental
OL,4,Ahealth centre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision is due on whether a church
OL,7,Fcan be turned into a mental health
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FThe Thanksgiving Shrine of Our Lady of
OL,11,FLourdes in Blackpool should be refused,
OL,12,Faccording to Blackpool Council planning
OL,13,Fofficers.
OL,15,FThey say there is another facility on
OL,16,Fnearby Newton Drive that is
OL,17,F"predominantly occupied by men from the
OL,18,Fwider Lancashire and South Cumbria
OL,19,Farea" and that the applicant, Cygnet,
OL,20,Fhas "failed to demonstrate that there
OL,21,Fis a locally generated demand" for
OL,22,Fanother centre.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
